# Environment variables required for this project
# Copy this file to .env (for frontend) and .dev.vars (for worker) and fill in the values
# Neither .env nor .dev.vars should ever be committed to git
#
# IMPORTANT: VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID and GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID must be the SAME value.
# Use a single "Web application" Client ID from Google Cloud Console for both.
#
# Production (Cloudflare Pages):
# - Build env: set VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (so the frontend bundle gets it at build time).
# - Worker env (Settings → Variables and Secrets): set GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID to the same value.

# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID — same value in both (frontend + worker)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
